00311: {"id":"CORE-C0311","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[208,208],"text":"独立对照：起始 PP1，第一次到 0，第二次无 PP 拒绝不再减并正常写已动；去有效亲子爱，正常单击 PP5→4、U71 并已动，没有该续击异常；第二次前置拒绝则不再扣 PP、按正常拒绝结束写已动。已经写本轮已动后才出错、决定已正、使用者失能、选择改型/清除或换位，须按实际门重判，不能只凭捕获推重试。裸普通使用调用没有此单席位包装时，错误向其实际调用者传播，不自行产生调度重试；号令/舞者等嵌套入口按各自保存恢复规则。诊断自己失败、非一般异常或包裹外错误可能到更外层，不保证 PP3、完整清理、进程退出、宿主恢复或任意异常集合的全局终止性。全部为未执行的有限静态后继。","facts":[]}
00312: {"id":"CORE-C0312","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[212,212],"text":"首发检查（每目标一次）：两回合蓄力期直接通过；招式自有对目标失败；精神场地＋优先招 →「精神场地保护」；工艺盾（变化招、非全体目标）；守卫族（全体护/快/广域，跳跃点：无视护罩特性＋接触招除外）；保护/王盾/尖刺盾/剧毒壁垒/障壁/垫子（各自附带接触反制：降攻、伤害 1/8、中毒、降防）；魔法外衣/魔法反弹（变化招、非半无敌、对敌）；特性免疫（先于属性免疫）；属性免疫（伤害招且相性无效）；恶属性对恶作剧之心加速招免疫；浮空对地面招（漂浮/气球/磁力/意念移物各具名）；粉末招式（草＋更多属性效果/防尘/护目镜）；替身（变化招、非无视替身）。","facts":[]}
00313: {"id":"CORE-C0313","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[214,214],"text":"每击检查：蓄力期通过；锁定命中（锁定/心眼位）；招式覆盖；无防守、未来攻击标记或帮助类只在此层允许越过相应半无敌/天空摔投阻挡，不因此直接返回命中真；未获该豁免时，半无敌（天空/地下/水中/去除保护）不匹配 → 未命中，被天空摔投且非使用者且招式非击中飞行 → 未命中；跳过命中（跳过命中检查标记为真，按 §5.2 的调用分类）；命中计算（含反击/镜反）；未命中 → 按目标状态显示消息族（爱心回避/多目标「躲开了」/招式自定义/通用「攻击落空」）。","facts":[]}
00314: {"id":"CORE-C0314","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[216,216],"text":"N01 局部校准（2026-09-27，独立首审已确认新证据）：普通命中入口的用户/目标无防守处理器可把基础命中设为 0，目标方处理器受模式破坏者门控制；普通命中数值和该门引用 WP43。普通非特殊调用、基础命中 70、双方命中/闪避 0 阶、用户模式破坏者有效且无无防守、目标有效无防守，排除其它提前门和修正时，抽取 69 命中、70 未命中；关闭模式破坏者则目标处理器可使普通命中通过。此结论不推广到所有特殊命中家族。旧「一方有即命中」的概括据新证据在本轮实际改写；既有两标志/PP 合同及旧 12 项关闭保留，实际修订及传播已于 2026-09-27 有限复审 CLOSED。","facts":[]}
00315: {"id":"CORE-C0315","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[220,220],"text":"1. 招式可否选择复查（不通过 → 失败标记）。","facts":[]}
00316: {"id":"CORE-C0316","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[221,221],"text":"2. 天空摔投中（无消息）→ 失败。","facts":[]}
00317: {"id":"CORE-C0317","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[222,222],"text":"3. 破坏死光回复期（早于懒惰）：消息「必须回复！」；若特性懒惰则翻转懒惰标记；失败。","facts":[]}
00318: {"id":"CORE-C0318","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[223,223],"text":"4. 战斗宫殿特殊通道（非普通命令）→「似乎无法使用力量！」、失败。","facts":[]}
00319: {"id":"CORE-C0319","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[224,224],"text":"5. 跳过命中检查标记为真（特殊调用且非挣扎）→ 跳过第 6–12 步；为假（普通、挣扎、原始为普通的多回合续招）→ 依序执行 6–12。","facts":[]}
00320: {"id":"CORE-C0320","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[225,225],"text":"6. 状态延续：睡眠计数递减/醒来或继续（非可睡用招 → 失败）；冰冻 20% 自解否则继续（可自融招免检）。","facts":[]}
00321: {"id":"CORE-C0321","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[226,226],"text":"7. 服从检查（§5.6）。","facts":[]}
00322: {"id":"CORE-C0322","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[227,227],"text":"8. 懒惰：翻转后若为「偷懒」→ 消息、失败。","facts":[]}
00323: {"id":"CORE-C0323","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[228,228],"text":"9. 畏怯 → 消息、失败（并触发「畏怯时」特性）。","facts":[]}
00324: {"id":"CORE-C0324","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[229,229],"text":"10. 混乱：计数递减/解除或 33%（世代 ≥ 7；更早 50%）自伤混乱伤害 → 失败。","facts":[]}
00325: {"id":"CORE-C0325","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[230,230],"text":"11. 麻痹 25% → 失败。","facts":[]}
00326: {"id":"CORE-C0326","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[231,231],"text":"12. 着迷 50% → 失败（显示着迷对象）。","facts":[]}
00327: {"id":"CORE-C0327","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[235,235],"text":"换人行动前：顺序表中满足「对换人者对立、本回合未动、登记招函数为追击、可命中换人者、可继续选择、非睡眠/冰冻、非天空摔投、非懒惰偷懒」的席位——若其（非野生）已登记 Mega 则先 Mega——把追击目标改为被换者并立即执行其行动；执行后若决定 > 0 或换人者已濒死则停止。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00328: {"id":"CORE-C0328","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[239,239],"text":"- 只对：玩家拥有、游戏内战斗、动作非招式不检查、多回合续招不检查。","facts":[]}
00329: {"id":"CORE-C0329","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[240,240],"text":"- 临界等级 L = 10 ×（徽章数 + 1）；徽章 ≥ 8 → 取最大等级（等效无门）。","facts":[]}
00330: {"id":"CORE-C0330","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[241,241],"text":"- 默认 ANY_HIGH_LEVEL_POKEMON_CAN_DISOBEY=false、FOREIGN_HIGH_LEVEL_POKEMON_CAN_DISOBEY=true，两者独立可配置，不由世代自动决定。触发条件：配置「任意高等级可拒绝」或「外来高等级可拒绝＋个体为外来」；且 当前等级 > L：a = ⌊（等级 + L）× 0–255 抽样 ÷ 256⌋；a ≥ L → 计入不服从。","facts":[]}
00331: {"id":"CORE-C0331","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[242,242],"text":"- 超频不服从：暗影·超频中：非暗影招 → 0–99 抽样 < 20 才服从（暗影招与无招恒服从）。","facts":[]}
00332: {"id":"CORE-C0332","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[243,243],"text":"- 任一计入 → 进入不服从分支：","facts":[]}
00333: {"id":"CORE-C0333","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[244,244],"text":"  - 睡眠中且招可睡用（打鼾/梦话）→「无视指示继续睡」（动作终止，无 PP 损失前状态）。","facts":[]}
00334: {"id":"CORE-C0334","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[245,245],"text":"  - b = ⌊（等级 + L）× 0–255 抽样 ÷ 256⌋；b < L →「无视指示！」：若不能出示战斗菜单 → 终止；否则从其它可继续选择的招中随机改用（无其它招 → 终止）；改用后仍消耗所选新招 PP 并按新招执行。","facts":[]}
00335: {"id":"CORE-C0335","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[246,246],"text":"  - 否则：c = 等级 − L；r = 0–255 抽样；r < c 且可睡眠 → 自我入睡、终止；前一自我入睡门未命中且 r − c < c、非睡眠 → 混乱自伤、终止；再否则随机四选一拒绝消息（不肯服从/转过头去/偷懒磨蹭/装作没听见）、终止。","facts":[]}
00336: {"id":"CORE-C0336","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[247,247],"text":"- AI 选择与服从分离：AI 只产生「合法选择」，服从性在执行期作用于玩家拥有席位；两者不共用随机源描述。","facts":[]}
00337: {"id":"CORE-C0337","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[255,255],"text":"- 参与集合：现有席位（空位跳过）；每席位需要其身份、速度、招式优先级、特性/道具子优先级与最终子优先级、平局序。只规定比较输入及其来源，不规定七项条目或内部存储。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00338: {"id":"CORE-C0338","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[256,256],"text":"- 招式优先级：招式基础优先级 → 特性改写（先制类，WP48/WP50 提供具体族）；保存该行动的结果供精神场地/快守检查读取。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00339: {"id":"CORE-C0339","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[257,257],"text":"- 子优先级（仅招式与 Shift 选择计算）：特性族（如懒惰类）与道具族（先制爪/释迦果/迟钝尾/满腹香炉等）分别取子优先级；合并规则：若特性为 0 且道具有值、或特性为负而道具为正 → 采用道具并标记「道具来源」；否则若特性非 0 → 标记「特性来源」；两来源标记供提示消息。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00340: {"id":"CORE-C0340","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[258,258],"text":"- 平局序：全量计算时为随机洗牌序；每次全量计算重新随机——同一回合内多次调用（非全量）保持既有平局序稳定。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00341: {"id":"CORE-C0341","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[262,262],"text":"按序比较：招式优先级（高者先）→ 最终子优先级（高者先）→ 空间（戏法空间）状态：开启时速度低者先、否则速度高者先（比较速度值）→ 平局序。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00342: {"id":"CORE-C0342","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[266,266],"text":"- 全量计算：攻击阶段开始时一次。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00343: {"id":"CORE-C0343","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[267,267],"text":"- 增量重算（不重全量、可传席位子集）：仅当以下触发且配置开启：速度变化后（物品执行完之后/每次单席位行动之后）——重读速度与「特性改变的招式优先级」，任一变化即重排；戏法空间状态与快照不一致 → 重排（快照在计算时捕获）。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
00344: {"id":"CORE-C0344","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[268,268],"text":"- Mega 进化后：可选按「仅该席位」重算（配置）。","facts":["CORE-F029"]}
